"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nThis was the hotel I stayed at during my Melbourne trip.  \nI stayed in the standard  room, and the overall condition was very clean and comfortable — I was pleased with it.  \n\nTrue to the Hyatt brand, the sleek modern interior and tidy hygiene standards stood out.  \nThe only slightly disappointing part was that the bathroom didn't have a bidet.  \n\nEven so, the hotel's proximity to Melbourne's CBD made it excellent in terms of accessibility.  \nGetting to major attractions and tram stops was very convenient, and the surrounding infrastructure was well-developed.  \nAbove all, being able to book at a relatively  compared to other 5-star hotels made it a stay that delivered both great value and satisfaction.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"